&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607049795&quot; alt=&quot;A Random Day&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day&quot;  &gt;A Random Day&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; with their own article blurb for the next news page!&lt;/li&gt;
