						 <div style="border: 2px solid black; background-color: Moccasin;"> <p style="text-align: center;">The dynamic nature of this wiki means that linked pages might get moved, renamed, or deleted.</p> <p style="text-align: center;">This news archive remains as a time capsule and is not updated to account for these changes.</p> </div> <p>An archive of front-page news bulletins.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+2020</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-2020</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <ul> <li><strong>August 1, 2020</strong> - The winners in the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/instagram-fan-art-contest">Instagram Fan Art Contest</a> have been chosen and published.</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>February 8, 2020</strong> - The <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5000">SCP-5000</a> Contest is over! Congratulations to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=776854&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Tanhony" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=776854)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" >Tanhony</a></span> for winning the SCP-5000 slot!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>February 1, 2020</strong> - Check out <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/young-and-under-30">Underread and Underrated</a> for a deep dive into the hidden gems of SCP, complete with writing prompts and lore overviews!</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+2019</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-2019</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <ul> <li><strong>August 6, 2019</strong> - The <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/collaboration-contest">Collab Contest</a> has closed. Congratulations to all who entered!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>May 6, 2019</strong> - Please see the following announcement regarding an ongoing license violation in Russia: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-11572837/announcement-regarding-ongoing-license-violation">Announcement Thread Here</a>.</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>April 23, 2019</strong> - Join #workshop on the synIRC network on May 5 at 1 PM EST for <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-10752847/seminars-and-workshops">a seminar</a> on writing and creating dialogue!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>April 3, 2019</strong> - The winners of the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/144-hour-jam-contest">144-Hour Jam Contest</a> have been announced! Congratulations to everyone who participated! We had almost 140 entries, so go check them out! Also, don't forget to vote on your favorite <a href="http://scp-int.wikidot.com/international-goi-contest-2019">International Groups of Interest contest entries!</a></li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>March 29, 2019</strong> - The <strong><a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/">Wanderers' Library</a></strong> has been relaunched with a brand-new look and a vision for the future! If you've ever enjoyed the Library but longed for it to be less ugly and more active, your dream has just come true. Join the <a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/system:real-time-chat">Library Chat</a> and read the <a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/orientation">Orientation</a> for more information.</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>January 1, 2019</strong> - Happy New Year, Skippers! Welcome to 2019! In an effort to acknowledge and honor all of our hardworking reviewers, the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/reviewers-spotlight-archive">Reviewers' Spotlight</a> will be replacing the previous &quot;Event Featured&quot; block. Big thanks to all of our talented critiquers who keep the forums running and the site flourishing!</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+2018</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-2018</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <ul> <li><strong>October 7, 2018</strong> - The international branches of the SCP community have teamed up to bring you a collection of translated SCPs from around the world! New articles are posted daily, and you can view them at the <strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-international">International Branches Hub</a></strong>!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>August 17, 2018</strong> - The <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp4000contesthub">SCP-4000 Contest</a> is over! Be sure to check out all the entries! <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-series-5">Series V</a> is now open!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>July 12, 2018</strong> - <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scpdeclassified">SCPDeclassified</a>, a <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/SCPDeclassified/">subreddit</a> devoted to literary analyses and plot explanations of SCP articles and concepts, recently reached 10,000 subscribers. Congratulations to them, and we look forward to reading their future declassifications!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>June 20, 2018</strong> - The <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp4000contesthub">4000 Contest</a> is live! In honor of the site's 10th anniversary, the contest's theme is HISTORY! Here's to an epic contest and another ten years of SCP!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>May 21, 2018</strong> - The <strong><a href="http://scp-pt-br.wikidot.com/">Portuguese Branch</a></strong> is the newest member of the International SCP community! We wish them the best of luck and great success!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>May 5, 2018</strong> - Today marks the fifth anniversary of the <a href="http://lafundacionscp.wikidot.com/main">Spanish branch</a> of the wiki! Congratulations and here's to another five years of La Fundacion!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>April 2, 2018</strong> - Staff have started the process of migrating off of Wikidot, and we need <strong>your</strong> help. If you have professional experience in programming, quality assurance, marketing, law, finance, graphic design, or running a business or non-profit, and would be willing to donate your time and expertise, please sign up in the appropriate <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forum/c-3335629/recruitment">Recruitment thread</a>.</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>April 1, 2018</strong> - April Fool's is over. We hope everyone had fun, and enjoyed our little <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-5663706/happy-april-fool-s">pranks and easter eggs</a>!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>March 11, 2018</strong> - <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scpfmmdbc-hub">March Madness</a> returns (for real this time)! Get your predictions in now!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>February 2, 2018</strong> - THREE DAYS: That’s how long the next contest is! Join us for the first ever <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/72-hour-jam-contest">72-Hour Jam Contest</a> on February 17th!</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+2017</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-2017</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <ul> <li><strong>December 16, 2017</strong> - In the newest episode of his podcast <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/theresacactusinthecorner">The Foundation</a>, listen to moderator <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1414765&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Doctor Cimmerian" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1414765)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" >Doctor Cimmerian</a></span> do a deep dive on the articles and lore behind the Fifthist Church!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>September 30, 2017</strong> - Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drbleep" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2887044&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="DrBleep" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2887044)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drbleep" >DrBleep</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2938475&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Zhange" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2938475)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" >Zhange</a></span>, the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/news-08-2017">August Site News</a> page is live! As a note, all site authors with new pages each month can feel free to send a PM to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span> with their own article blurb for the next news page!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>September 18, 2017</strong> - A new fancy module in the sidebar allows for <strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-3646159/sidebar-translation-module">translated works</a></strong> to be linked from the original article. Credit to the SCP-RU team for making it possible!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>August 30, 2017</strong> - The <strong><a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com">Wanderers' Library</a></strong> and <strong><a href="http://visual-records.wikidot.com">Visual Records</a></strong> Sites have both received significant overhauls! The Library has been tweaking its content presentation for a few months now and has been given a fresh coat of paint! The Visual Records wiki has been scrubbed of all images which were not compliant with the CC-by-SA 3.0 License and can now fulfill its potential as a SCP Fuel and Artwork repository! It has also received a fresh coat of paint! Check 'em out!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>August 25, 2017</strong> - The <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/news-07-2017">July Site News</a> is now posted! Come check out all the new SCP articles, tales, author pages, hub pages, and more that were posted that month, compiled by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span>!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>August 14, 2017</strong> - To increase voting and readership for under-reviewed articles, a new site project has been started: the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/young-and-under-30">&quot;Young and under 30&quot;</a> project is aiming to get more attention to articles less than a year old, and with a score of less than +30. Come check it out and participate!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>August 1, 2017</strong> - Fire up the sketchbook and break out your art medium, for the <strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/social-media-art-contest">Internet Outreach Art Contest</a></strong> is underway! Entries are to be posted throughout the month!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>July 29, 2017</strong> - The <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/2017-survey-results">2017 Community Survey results</a> are out! Come see the snapshot of the worldwide SCP community that <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5888483&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Cyantreuse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5888483)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" >Cyantreuse</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/decibelles" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2005044&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Decibelles" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2005044)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/decibelles" >Decibelles</a></span> have developed!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>July 17, 2017</strong> - Artkast is live! Join us for this special episode of The Kaktuskast in which <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" >djkaktus</a></span> is joined by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/perelka-l" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1940138&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Perelka_L" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1940138)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/perelka-l" >Perelka_L</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2938475&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Zhange" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2938475)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" >Zhange</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" >SunnyClockwork</a></span> to talk about art, inspiration, and the sex appeal of the highest levels of senior staff. Check it out at <a href="https://www.djkakt.us/kaktuskast/2017/7/17/the-kaktuskast-ep-24-artkast2017">djkakt.us</a></li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>July 13, 2017</strong> - The Kaktuskast is back! Joining us on this special ReintroductionKast is <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/decibelles" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2005044&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Decibelles" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2005044)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/decibelles" >Decibelles</a></span>, to talk about music, audio, and TroyL's blood! Check the show out at <a href="https://www.djkakt.us/kaktuskast/2017/7/10/the-kaktuskast-ep-23-reintroductionkast">djkakt.us</a>, and check out the first episode of <a href="https://www.djkakt.us/the-foundation/">The Foundation</a>, hosted by staff's own <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1414765&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Doctor Cimmerian" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1414765)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" >Doctor Cimmerian</a></span>!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>July 10, 2017</strong> - Come read the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/news-06-2017">June Site News</a>! Big thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span> for compiling all of the new SCP articles, tales, author pages, hub pages, and more that were posted in June!</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>June 16, 2017</strong> - The <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/news-05-2017">May Site News</a> page has been posted! Come see all of the new SCP articles, tales, author pages, and more from last month&#8212;over a hundred new things were posted! Big, big thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span>, <span class="error-inline"><em>tretter</em> does not match any existing user name</span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shaggydredlocks" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1722371&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Shaggydredlocks" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1722371)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shaggydredlocks" >Shaggydredlocks</a></span> for putting together this amazing spread.</li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>April 26, 2017</strong> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drewbear" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=301632&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Drewbear" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=301632)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drewbear" >Drewbear</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5888483&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607049796" alt="Cyantreuse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5888483)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" >Cyantreuse</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&