&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5859&quot;&gt;SCP-5859&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;The PENTAGRAM Papers&amp;quot;) - Your favorite good old-fashioned conspiracy, like the old days. You like it? Revealed by Anorrack.&lt;/li&gt;
