&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/kelipat&quot;&gt;Kelipat Nogah&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;em&gt;With the inclusion of Paraspecialists provided by the GOC and the CotBG, Xi-8 should now be able to handle most, if not all mid-level Sarkic Infestations.&lt;/em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by MalyceGraves.&lt;/li&gt;
